meta {
  name: Refresh
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
  body: none
}

docs {
  Authenticated by the httpOnly cookie alone — no Authorization header.
  Run it twice in a row and the second call still succeeds: each call rotates
  the cookie. Replaying an OLD cookie is what triggers reuse detection.
}
